# Where "Explore Bambai" goes during development.
#
# In production both apps are served from one Cloudflare origin and the default
# relative "/app/" is correct.
#
# The name matters: a plain `.env` is loaded in EVERY mode, so it bakes this
# localhost URL straight into the production build — which it did, once. A
# `.env.development` file is only read when Vite runs in development.
VITE_MAP_URL=http://127.0.0.1:5173/app/
